// Title: Suspicious Child Process of AspNetCompiler
// Sigma ID: 9ccba514-7cb6-4c5c-b377-700758f2f120
// Status: test | Level: high
// Author: Nasreddine Bencherchali (Nextron Systems)
// Date: 2023-08-14 | Modified: -
// ATT&CK: execution, stealth, T1127
// Description: Detects potentially suspicious child processes of "aspnet_compiler.exe".
// False positives:
//   - Unknown
// References:
//   - https://lolbas-project.github.io/lolbas/Binaries/Aspnet_Compiler/
//   - https://ijustwannared.team/2020/08/01/the-curious-case-of-aspnet_compiler-exe/
// Sigma rule: https://github.com/SigmaHQ/sigma/blob/05d1031f537e830b76da53bae2400c5814c89165/rules/windows/process_creation/proc_creation_win_aspnet_compiler_susp_child_process.yml
// License: Detection Rule License (DRL) 1.1 - https://github.com/SigmaHQ/Detection-Rule-License
// Converted by sigma2kql (target: microsoft_xdr, pySigma 1.5.1, pySigma-backend-kusto 1.0.1)
// Validation: passed (Kusto.Language 12.4.1, live Defender schema)
// Machine-generated and not tested against real telemetry. Verify before use as a detection.

DeviceProcessEvents
| where InitiatingProcessFolderPath endswith "\\aspnet_compiler.exe" and ((FolderPath endswith "\\calc.exe" or FolderPath endswith "\\notepad.exe") or (FolderPath contains "\\Users\\Public\\" or FolderPath contains "\\AppData\\Local\\Temp\\" or FolderPath contains "\\AppData\\Local\\Roaming\\" or FolderPath contains ":\\Temp\\" or FolderPath contains ":\\Windows\\Temp\\" or FolderPath contains ":\\Windows\\System32\\Tasks\\" or FolderPath contains ":\\Windows\\Tasks\\"))
